  m_text: 'First Rule of Hunt is to Play with Noticing Things, He can Hear You but
    not only that he was capable of more.


    First You need to Restore the Power
    (It looks like a Generator).


    Then you need to collect a Formula Book and
    the Sample Blood Tube.


    Then you need to call the Emergency Backup and Give
    them the signal you''ve got their requireed things.


    Then Go to the extraction
    point.'
